<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Config - Service Monitor - Microsoft Skype for Business Services - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>Configures the BES Service Monitor (<STRONG>Fixlet: </STRONG>Invoke - Service Monitor - Windows) to monitor services.</P>
<P>Specifically, this fixlet configures it to monitor the following Microsoft Skype for Business Services:</P>
<OL>
<LI>Lync Server Access Edge (RtcSrv)
<LI>Lync Server Application Sharing (RTCASMCU)
<LI>Lync Server Audio Test Service (RTCATS)
<LI>Lync Server Audio/Video Authentication (RTCMRAUTH)
<LI>Lync Server Audio/Video Conferencing (RTCAVMCU)
<LI>Lync Server Audio/Video Edge (RTCMEDIARELAY)
<LI>Lync Server Backup Service (LYNCBACKUP)
<LI>Lync Server Bandwidth Policy Service (Authentication) (RTCPDPAUTH)
<LI>Lync Server Bandwidth Policy Service (Core) (RTCPDPCORE)
<LI>Lync Server Call Park (RTCCPS)
<LI>Lync Server Centralized Logging Service Agent (RTCCLSAGT)
<LI>Lync Server Conferencing Announcement (RTCCAS)
<LI>Lync Server Conferencing Attendant (RTCCAA)
<LI>Lync Server File Transfer Agent (FTA)
<LI>Lync Server Front-End (RtcSrv)
<LI>Lync Server IM Conferencing (RTCIMMCU)
<LI>Lync Server Master Replicator Agent (MASTER)
<LI>Lync Server Mediation (RTCMEDSRV)
<LI>Lync Server Persistent Chat (RTCCHAT)
<LI>Lync Server Replica Replicator Agent (REPLICA)
<LI>Lync Server Response Group (RTCRGS)
<LI>Lync Server Web Conferencing (RTCDATAMCU)
<LI>Lync Server Web Conferencing Edge (RTCDATAPROXY)
<LI>Lync Server XMPP Translating Gateway (RTCXMPPTGW)
<LI>Lync Server XMPP Translating Gateway Proxy (RTCXMPPTGWPX) </LI></OL>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Inventory content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance>exists services (substrings separated by &quot;;&quot; of &quot;RtcSrv;RTCASMCU;RTCATS;RTCMRAUTH;RTCAVMCU;RTCMEDIARELAY;RTCPDPAUTH;RTCPDPCORE;RTCCPS;RTCCLSAGT;RTCCAS;RTCCAA;FTA;RtcSrv;RTCIMMCU;MASTER;RTCMEDSRV;RTCCHAT;REPLICA;RTCRGS;RTCDATAMCU;RTCDATAPROXY;RTCXMPPTGW;RTCXMPPTGWPX;LYNCBACKUP&quot;)</Relevance>
    <Relevance>not exists values whose (it = &quot;RtcSrv;RTCASMCU;RTCATS;RTCMRAUTH;RTCAVMCU;RTCMEDIARELAY;RTCPDPAUTH;RTCPDPCORE;RTCCPS;RTCCLSAGT;RTCCAS;RTCCAA;FTA;RtcSrv;RTCIMMCU;MASTER;RTCMEDSRV;RTCCHAT;REPLICA;RTCRGS;RTCDATAMCU;RTCDATAPROXY;RTCXMPPTGW;RTCXMPPTGWPX;LYNCBACKUP&quot;) of settings &quot;besservicemonitor-microsoft-lync&quot; of client</Relevance>
    <Category>Service Monitor</Category>
    <Source>Internal</Source>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2016-10-25</SourceReleaseDate>
    <MIMEField>
    	<Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
    	<Value>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 20:56:29 +0000</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <DefaultAction ID="Action1">
      <Description>
        <PreLink>Click </PreLink>
        <Link>here</Link>
        <PostLink> to deploy this action.</PostLink>
      </Description>
      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell">setting &quot;besservicemonitor-microsoft-lync&quot;=&quot;RtcSrv;RTCASMCU;RTCATS;RTCMRAUTH;RTCAVMCU;RTCMEDIARELAY;RTCPDPAUTH;RTCPDPCORE;RTCCPS;RTCCLSAGT;RTCCAS;RTCCAA;FTA;RtcSrv;RTCIMMCU;MASTER;RTCMEDSRV;RTCCHAT;REPLICA;RTCRGS;RTCDATAMCU;RTCDATAPROXY;RTCXMPPTGW;RTCXMPPTGWPX;LYNCBACKUP&quot; on &quot;{now}&quot; for client</ActionScript>
    </DefaultAction>
  </Fixlet>
</BES>
